---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
import refs from '../../../../../public/equipment/15-01/references.json';
import v from '../../../../../public/equipment/15-01/verification.json';
const a='/equipment/15-01/';
---
<Layout pageTitle="Kopf Model 940 · Documentary outline" subtitle="" description="Orbit a solid photographic silhouette of the Model 940 and try a separate triangle illustration." wide={true}>
<article class="equipment kp1501">
<nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/15-01/">← Equipment 15-01</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Equipment register</a><a href="#evidence">Sources &amp; checks</a></nav>
<header class="eq-mast"><span class="eq-meta">15-01 / Static museum-style outline and separate geometry card</span><h2>David Kopf Instruments Model 940 · Documentary outline</h2><p>Inspect a nonfunctional silhouette and its blank console. The separate triangle card shows how three fixed line lengths can enclose an area, flatten into a line, or fail to close.</p></header>
<div class="dn-grid"><section class="dn-card"><h3>3D documentary exhibit</h3>
<div class="dn-bar"><button data-view="whole">Whole exhibit</button><button data-view="front">Exhibit close-up</button><button data-view="side">Display side</button><button data-view="chart">Triangle card</button><button id="camera-reset">Reset view</button></div>
<div class="dn-camera"><canvas id="kopf-model" aria-label="Solid metallic Model 940 exterior outline, a blank disconnected console, and a separate triangle card"></canvas></div>
<p id="asset" class="dn-note" role="status">Loading metric GLB…</p><p class="dn-note">Drag to orbit, pinch or scroll to zoom. The amber triangle-card key cycles fixed illustrations; the pale key hides or shows side labels. The instrument and console have no controls or moving parts.</p></section>
<section class="dn-card"><h3>When does a triangle close?</h3><div class="dn-bar"><label>Fixed sides <select id="shape"><option value="right">6, 8, 10</option><option value="wide">6, 8, 12</option><option value="flat">6, 8, 14</option><option value="impossible">6, 8, 15</option></select></label><button class="primary" id="labels" aria-pressed="true">Hide length labels</button><button id="reset">Reset</button></div>
<canvas id="triangle-card" width="480" height="320" role="img" aria-label="Synthetic fixed side triangle illustration or its exact failure to close"></canvas>
<p class="dn-note" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Closed triangle · area 24.00 square units · perimeter 24 units.</p>
<div class="dn-bar"><button id="json">Export artwork JSON</button><a href={a+'example-triangle.json'}>Example result</a></div>
<p class="dn-note">The two shorter sides must sum to more than the longest to enclose a positive area. Equality gives a line; a smaller sum leaves a gap. The lengths are artwork units and have no relation to the equipment.</p></section></div>
<section id="evidence"><h3>Sources and independent checks</h3>
<div class="photo-pair">
<figure><img src={a+'reference-overview.webp'} width="640" height="400" alt="Original front three-quarter render of a silver silhouette with fixed blocks and a blank cream console" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Original render from the GLB. The <a href={refs.references[0].url}>manufacturer photograph</a> informs the outer color, pedestal outline, upright profile, and three-window console. Fine hardware has been replaced by solid inoperable forms.</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img src={a+'reference-side.webp'} width="640" height="400" alt="Original rear-side render revealing the deliberately fused silhouette and blank console case" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Original side render of the same GLB. All heights and small shapes are estimates, not hardware drawings.</figcaption></figure>
</div>
<ul>{refs.references.map(r=><li><a href={r.url}>{r.title}</a>. {r.caption}</li>)}</ul>
<p>Only the nominal exterior plate width and depth are anchored to the Model 940 listing, <b>254 × 353.06 mm</b>. This is not a working frame or build plan. No adjustable mechanisms, instrument readout, tracking, adapters, positioning geometry, calibration, coordinate transforms, procedure, or specimen/anatomy are implemented. The register's planned positioning benchmark is not part of this page.</p>
<div class="dn-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Check</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Tolerance</th><th>Result</th></tr></thead><tbody>{v.checks.map(c=><tr><th scope="row">{c.id}</th><td>{String(c.expected)} {c.unit}</td><td>{typeof c.actual==='number'?Number(c.actual.toFixed(8)):String(c.actual)} {c.unit}</td><td>{c.tolerance===0?'Exact':c.tolerance}</td><td>{c.pass?'Pass':'Fail'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
<p><a href={a+'build-model.py'} download>Editable outline</a> · <a href={a+'kopf940-outline.glb'} download>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={a+'references.json'}>Reference notes</a> · <a href={a+'vr-station.json'}>VR action manifest</a> · <a href={a+'triangles.mjs'}>Independent math module</a> · <a href={a+'verification.json'}>Verification JSON</a>. No headset session tested.</p>
</section></article></Layout><script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/15-01/client.mjs';</script>
<style>
.kp1501{--dn-rule:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 26%,transparent);max-width:1280px;margin:auto}.dn-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.08fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem}.dn-card{min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--dn-rule);padding:.85rem;margin:.8rem 0}.dn-card h3{margin:.21rem 0 .6rem}.dn-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem;margin:.53rem 0}.dn-bar,.dn-note,.dn-fig figcaption{font:.89rem/1.4 system-ui,sans-serif}
.kp1501 :is(button,select){font:inherit;padding:.4rem;background:var(--panel,Canvas);color:inherit;border:1px solid var(--dn-rule);border-radius:3px;min-height:38px;cursor:pointer}.kp1501 .primary{background:#34594f;color:#fff}.dn-camera{aspect-ratio:1.34;background:#263b40}.dn-camera canvas{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;touch-action:none}.kp1501 #triangle-card{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-width:492px;margin:.6rem 0}.dn-table{overflow:auto}.dn-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.dn-table :is(td,th){border-bottom:1px solid var(--dn-rule);padding:.42rem;text-align:left}.dn-fig{margin:1rem 0;max-width:680px}.dn-fig img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.dn-fig figcaption{margin:.38rem 0}@media(max-width:850px){.dn-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.kp1501 .photo-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.8rem;max-width:860px}.kp1501 .photo-pair figure{margin:0}.kp1501 .photo-pair img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.kp1501 .photo-pair figcaption{font:.86rem/1.4 system-ui,sans-serif;margin:.3rem 0}@media(max-width:600px){.kp1501 .photo-pair{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
